WEBVTT

00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:17.130
Nusumareta kako wo

00:00:17.130 --> 00:00:20.330
Sagashitsuzukete

00:00:21.460 --> 00:00:23.420
Ore wa samayou

00:00:23.420 --> 00:00:27.130
Mishiranu machi wo

00:00:27.330 --> 00:00:32.080
Honou no nioi shimitsuite

00:00:32.330 --> 00:00:33.880
Museru

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:37.630
Sayonara wa itta hazu da

00:00:37.630 --> 00:00:40.540
Wakareta hazu sa

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:43.790
Jigoku wo mireba

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:47.330
Kokoro ga kawaku

00:00:47.460 --> 00:00:52.750
Tatakai wa akita no sa

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:57.540
Sadame to areba

00:00:57.710 --> 00:01:00.790
Kokoro wo kimeru

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:05.960
Sottoshite oite kure

00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:07.750
Ashita ni

00:01:07.920 --> 00:01:15.250
Aa tsunagaru kyou gurai

00:01:44.750 --> 00:01:48.670
The last thing I remember is escaping
the jungles of Kummen with Fyana.

00:01:49.500 --> 00:01:51.500
There's no doubt about that.

00:01:52.540 --> 00:01:58.040
But, right after that, something grabbed us.

00:02:06.750 --> 00:02:08.540
Where am I?

00:02:09.500 --> 00:02:11.000
Why am I here?

00:02:11.080 --> 00:02:16.080
Friends

00:02:16.540 --> 00:02:20.000
When I came to, I discovered
we were aboard a warship.

00:02:20.500 --> 00:02:22.080
Just the two of us.

00:02:22.710 --> 00:02:24.960
To this ship, on its unknown course.

00:02:24.960 --> 00:02:28.540
To the people who brought us here. And...

00:02:28.540 --> 00:02:29.210
And?

00:02:30.920 --> 00:02:32.380
To us.

00:02:40.710 --> 00:02:43.170
It's quiet. So quiet.

00:02:43.920 --> 00:02:46.750
Where do you suppose this ship is taking us?

00:02:46.750 --> 00:02:49.250
No matter where it goes, I'll always be with you.

00:03:05.080 --> 00:03:09.040
I was almost grateful to the mysterious
intelligence who had brought us onto that ship.

00:03:09.040 --> 00:03:10.580
And then...

00:03:31.960 --> 00:03:33.380
The Red Shoulders...

00:03:49.750 --> 00:03:52.580
I am a Red Shoulder...

00:03:52.580 --> 00:03:53.830
I am...

00:03:53.830 --> 00:03:54.790
Stop it!

00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:56.170
Stop it!

00:03:59.130 --> 00:04:02.960
Who was trying to rip open
the old wounds I'd finally closed?

00:04:09.330 --> 00:04:13.000
Somebody wants me to remember
a past I want to forget.

00:04:13.750 --> 00:04:15.750
A past I need to forget!

00:04:22.460 --> 00:04:23.960
It was horrible.

00:04:23.960 --> 00:04:28.210
We didn't know the true intentions of
whoever had brought us here,

00:04:28.210 --> 00:04:31.420
but it was clear that they held
no good will towards me.

00:04:41.790 --> 00:04:43.670
I pity you so, my darling.

00:04:44.170 --> 00:04:47.250
As much as being a PS hurts me,

00:04:47.250 --> 00:04:51.670
the pain the past inflicts on
your heart is far worse.

00:04:52.210 --> 00:04:53.380
That's right.

00:04:53.380 --> 00:04:57.420
Love was something that had
no place in my heart.

00:04:58.210 --> 00:05:02.380
No matter what his past is,
my feelings won't change.

00:05:08.790 --> 00:05:11.790
This is Balarant patrol group 7.

00:05:12.250 --> 00:05:14.380
You have violated our territorial space!

00:05:14.380 --> 00:05:16.540
Stop your ship at once!

00:05:17.130 --> 00:05:20.080
You are ordered to stop at once!

00:05:20.540 --> 00:05:23.380
Failure to comply will force us to open fire on you!

00:05:36.920 --> 00:05:40.750
The sudden Balarant attack
was what saved my soul.

00:05:41.880 --> 00:05:45.630
But then, I always ended up
running away into a battle like this.

00:05:46.830 --> 00:05:49.000
Only in battle...

00:06:47.710 --> 00:06:48.790
The only place...

00:06:49.960 --> 00:06:51.290
I feel at home...

00:06:52.290 --> 00:06:54.000
is in battle!

00:07:08.920 --> 00:07:12.080
Fyana! The Balarant are retreating!

00:07:12.630 --> 00:07:16.750
Fyana... Don't worry. I'm here with you.

00:07:17.330 --> 00:07:20.420
Fyana, we...

00:07:21.960 --> 00:07:24.630
I just want to forget everything.

00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:29.500
All I want now is you... Fyana!

00:07:38.290 --> 00:07:42.670
That's right, I was wounded in
the battle with the Balarant.

00:07:45.040 --> 00:07:46.250
So tired...

00:07:47.250 --> 00:07:48.710
I'll rest a while...

00:08:33.420 --> 00:08:34.500
Proto One...

00:08:43.630 --> 00:08:45.460
So, Chirico can't move?

00:08:46.420 --> 00:08:49.250
He's hurt badly. I have a favor to ask.

00:08:51.380 --> 00:08:52.290
Then ask it.

00:08:55.040 --> 00:08:56.540
Let me guess.

00:08:58.380 --> 00:09:01.290
You want us to spare Chirico
if you return to the Society.

00:09:01.290 --> 00:09:04.130
Please! Just let him live!

00:09:04.130 --> 00:09:05.920
I don't care what happens to me!

00:09:05.920 --> 00:09:07.500
I'll do whatever you want.

00:09:07.500 --> 00:09:09.000
Is that all you have to say?

00:09:09.000 --> 00:09:12.170
Yes! Just spare Chirico and-

00:09:12.170 --> 00:09:13.250
Shut up!

00:09:13.540 --> 00:09:16.670
I owe no favors to the one who cast me into Hell!

00:09:17.250 --> 00:09:20.040
Now, Proto One. Come to me.

00:09:20.210 --> 00:09:23.330
No! I won't abandon Chirico!

00:09:23.330 --> 00:09:25.130
You WILL come back with me!

00:09:28.420 --> 00:09:29.420
Don't shoot!

00:09:30.130 --> 00:09:31.290
I'll do it!

00:09:55.380 --> 00:09:56.210
Chirico!

00:10:11.420 --> 00:10:13.080
Open fire!

00:10:18.670 --> 00:10:20.330
Captain, Proto One's-!

00:10:23.460 --> 00:10:24.880
Proto One, come back!

00:10:24.880 --> 00:10:26.460
All units, move in!

00:11:31.380 --> 00:11:32.380
Get her!

00:11:49.630 --> 00:11:50.380
Fyana!

00:11:50.380 --> 00:11:51.580
Chirico...

00:12:19.960 --> 00:12:20.670
Chirico!

00:12:59.380 --> 00:13:00.460
Damn you!

00:13:03.960 --> 00:13:05.750
Chirico! Are you all right?

00:13:05.750 --> 00:13:07.330
Yeah, I'm fine.

00:13:07.630 --> 00:13:10.380
Get inside the ship! I'll need your help in there!

00:13:10.380 --> 00:13:11.380
Inside?

00:13:11.380 --> 00:13:14.080
I'm going to lure Ypsilon in front of
the main engine nozzle.

00:13:14.080 --> 00:13:16.250
Stand by in the control room! Go!

00:13:16.250 --> 00:13:17.080
Chirico!

00:14:11.790 --> 00:14:13.580
This will be your graveyard!

00:14:31.130 --> 00:14:33.130
Chirico! I'm all set!

00:14:47.460 --> 00:14:49.380
This is a question of timing. Get ready!

00:15:29.080 --> 00:15:30.750
I won't let you hurt Chirico!

00:15:32.790 --> 00:15:34.580
You can't shoot me.

00:15:34.580 --> 00:15:37.040
I can! I love him!

00:15:37.040 --> 00:15:39.330
You can't shoot me!

00:15:56.380 --> 00:15:57.210
Let's go!

00:16:04.880 --> 00:16:06.330
Now! Do it!

00:16:06.750 --> 00:16:07.460
Ypsilon!

00:16:07.830 --> 00:16:08.540
Hurry!

00:16:30.540 --> 00:16:32.460
Ypsilon...

00:16:33.130 --> 00:16:34.380
Forgive me!

00:16:57.130 --> 00:16:59.250
We abandoned the ship.

00:17:00.250 --> 00:17:03.420
I think our mysterious overseer
had forecast that as well.

00:17:04.580 --> 00:17:07.380
I wondered what else he had scripted out for us.

00:19:00.790 --> 00:19:01.580
Wait!

00:19:01.580 --> 00:19:04.210
Chirico, tune to 75 MHz!

00:19:08.000 --> 00:19:10.040
What? They're your friends?

00:19:10.040 --> 00:19:13.500
I dunno! That's what I came to find out!

00:19:15.000 --> 00:19:17.170
You, in the AT! Do you hear me?

00:19:17.380 --> 00:19:18.540
Yeah, I hear you!

00:19:19.630 --> 00:19:21.040
That voice... Chirico!

00:19:21.040 --> 00:19:22.710
Yeah... Gotho?

00:19:24.630 --> 00:19:26.330
I knew it!

00:19:26.330 --> 00:19:28.380
Man, you really dragged me
out a ways for this visit!

00:19:28.380 --> 00:19:29.920
Where are you, old man?

00:19:29.920 --> 00:19:31.500
Over your damn fool head!

00:19:40.080 --> 00:19:43.670
I finally found you! You really had me worried!

00:19:52.250 --> 00:19:53.710
Man, what a mess!

00:19:53.710 --> 00:19:57.540
If I'd known what kinda guy I was attacking,
I'd have been scared stiff!

00:19:59.170 --> 00:20:01.330
So, they're your friends, Mr. Gotho?

00:20:01.330 --> 00:20:03.080
You hang out with some tough customers!

00:20:04.460 --> 00:20:08.920
Chirico, these guys collect
wrecked weapons left on the battlefield.

00:20:08.920 --> 00:20:11.130
Guess you could call them scrap dealers.

00:20:11.130 --> 00:20:13.670
Scrap dealers? That makes us sound bad!

00:20:14.460 --> 00:20:17.250
We prefer to call ourselves
Weapons Restoration Specialists.

00:20:17.250 --> 00:20:22.790
It takes brains to collect usable parts
and assemble missiles. Right?

00:20:24.040 --> 00:20:26.420
Well, I'd call you clients in any case!

00:21:01.130 --> 00:21:02.500
Chirico!

00:21:04.130 --> 00:21:05.330
Hey there!

00:21:06.170 --> 00:21:10.960
I've missed you, man!
You look great, you old dog!

00:21:11.500 --> 00:21:13.750
And so do you, Miss Phantom.

00:21:13.750 --> 00:21:15.960
Thanks for helping us escape from Kummen.

00:21:17.130 --> 00:21:18.210
No problem.

00:21:18.790 --> 00:21:22.920
So, where'd you two run off to?
Like a couple of newlyweds!

00:21:23.500 --> 00:21:26.750
What's wrong, Coconna? Say hello to them.

00:21:31.210 --> 00:21:33.040
Oh, for Pete's sake!

00:21:33.040 --> 00:21:35.460
Chirico, say something to her!

00:21:37.790 --> 00:21:39.420
For crying out loud...

00:21:39.420 --> 00:21:42.130
Come on, say something!

00:21:46.420 --> 00:21:48.380
I hate to admit it, but you are pretty!

00:21:48.380 --> 00:21:50.130
Hey! Coconna!

00:21:50.880 --> 00:21:54.000
Great, she's in one of her moods again.

00:21:55.250 --> 00:21:58.540
My friends had returned,
each one seemingly unchanged.

00:22:00.710 --> 00:22:06.960
But, of course, our mysterious overseer
had arranged for another "old friend" to appear.

00:22:11.080 --> 00:22:12.080
Yeah, what?

00:22:12.080 --> 00:22:13.580
I know Chirico's in there!

00:22:13.880 --> 00:22:15.920
Turn him over to us and we won't attack!

00:22:15.920 --> 00:22:17.750
You have ten seconds to respond!

00:22:18.580 --> 00:22:20.790
We're not turning anybody over to you!

00:22:21.750 --> 00:22:22.750
Chirico!

00:22:27.170 --> 00:22:29.000
Yes, Ypsilon.

00:22:29.880 --> 00:22:33.040
I guess I really can call you a soulmate of mine.

00:22:35.290 --> 00:22:37.540
You and I are both killing machines.

00:22:39.210 --> 00:22:40.170
Yes...

00:22:41.290 --> 00:22:43.580
And, this time, we'll settle this once and for all.

00:22:54.290 --> 00:22:55.750
Next Episode

00:22:55.920 --> 00:22:58.830
A world whose surface is covered
by grain after grain of sand.

00:22:58.830 --> 00:23:00.960
A world which hides infinite secrets.

00:23:01.290 --> 00:23:03.170
Secrets to everything are here.

00:23:03.670 --> 00:23:06.130
Of PSs. Of the Hundred Years War.

00:23:06.130 --> 00:23:08.540
Of the Gilgamesh. Of the Balarant.

00:23:08.960 --> 00:23:11.630
And everyone eventually ends up here.

00:23:11.630 --> 00:23:14.330
Beating sunlight. Constant winds.

00:23:14.630 --> 00:23:17.460
History itself lies sleeping in the silence.

00:23:17.460 --> 00:23:19.460
Next time, "Quent"

00:23:19.790 --> 00:23:22.250
Will Chirico encounter his past here as well?

00:23:19.790 --> 00:23:24.290
Quent

00:23:19.790 --> 00:23:24.290
Next Time

00:23:42.540 --> 00:23:46.000
Samishii toki mo

00:23:46.000 --> 00:23:49.540
Kanashii toki mo

00:23:49.540 --> 00:23:55.920
Itsumo anata ga me ni ukabu

00:23:56.420 --> 00:23:59.960
Hitori no toki mo

00:23:59.960 --> 00:24:03.380
Aitai toki mo

00:24:03.380 --> 00:24:09.630
Itsumo anata wa mune no naka

00:24:09.630 --> 00:24:13.130
Tooku hanarete itemo

00:24:13.130 --> 00:24:16.540
Tatoe wakarete itemo

00:24:16.710 --> 00:24:23.040
Kono yo no hikari to tomo ni mabushiku

00:24:23.420 --> 00:24:29.380
Ano hi no anata ga...
